          "documentation_url": "https://github.com/kyuz0/amd-r9700-ai-toolboxes",
          "notes": [
            "Requires two AMD Radeon AI PRO R9700 devices; HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1 is preset when this profile is selected.",
            "Validated on mainline llama.cpp build 10789 with ROCm 10.0/HIP at native 262144 context using q8_0 KV cache and lazy ngram loading.",
